SUMMARY:Community Read: Working with Octopuses
LOCATION:Lower Mills Library\, 27 Richmond St\, Dorchester\, MA 02124
DESCRIPTION:Ever wondered what it’s like to work with octopuses\, squid\,
  and cuttlefish? Join undergraduate students Vivian Ives and Julian Hidalg
 o of Northeastern University as they dive into their research experience a
 t the Marine Biological Laboratory in Woods Hole. Discover how these incre
 dible creatures change colors\, solve puzzles\, and adapt to their environ
 ment. Hear what it’s like behind the scenes of marine research and aquar
 ium work\, and how you can take part in the science.\nhttps://bpl.biblioco
